  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU SME Competitiveness and Inclusion Programme in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the Action is to provide urgent support to war-affected MSMEs in Ukraine in their business recovery needs and to overcome challenges and disruptions caused by the war on Ukraine, as well as in green investment. The Action will pilot new approaches to support acutely war affected groups such as war veterans, internally displaced persons or businesses that have experienced asset destruction, supporting the economic reintegration of these groups, while promoting higher inclusion standards and gender mainstreaming in the financial sector and among SMEs. The EU contribution covers grant incentive payments for eligible investments.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
